+The shipped worker modules cover text display, seed controls, line cycling and dynamic widget visibility. Full legacy fullscreen/history, global UI customization, embedding and XY text autocomplete, and target-picker parity remain incomplete or unqualified. Earlier worker/iframe evidence must be read against its original source/runtime bindings. Final browser/frontend qualification remains pending.
+
+Root owns final source review, trusted build and dependency/profile selection, manifest generation, permission adoption, installed readiness, native/Guest comparisons and external acceptance readback. These notes do not promote original-node counts or mark the whole pack complete.
